title: War Profiteers
subtitle: Someone is getting rich from the war.
tags: event
view-if: war and profiteering_timer <= 0 and not finale
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_trade.svg
on-arrival: {! Q.profiteering_timer = 6; Q.corruption += 2; !}

= War Profiteers

Kuat Drive Yards, Rothana Heavy Engineering and the Banking Clan are making fortunes from the war. Contracts are awarded without competition, prices double every quarter, and several senators on the procurement committee have suddenly bought new estates.

- @investigate: Demand an investigation.
- @tax: Propose a war-profits tax.
- @ignore: The war must be won first.

@investigate
subtitle: Less corruption; the Security Bloc is annoyed.
on-arrival: corruption -= 2.5; sec_relation -= 4; faith += 0.5

The inquiry finds what everyone expected. Two senators resign.

@tax
subtitle: +2 treasury; the guilds and the Security Bloc object.
on-arrival: treasury += 2; guild_relation -= 5; sec_relation -= 3; rimward_dissent -= 3

The war-profits tax passes narrowly. The shipyards' lobbyists are already working on loopholes.

@ignore
subtitle: The Hawks agree; corruption grows.
on-arrival: corruption += 1; hawk_dissent -= 2
